How about the D/T64 UNIX web page? http://www.unix.digital.com . Note
that the DUNIX 4.0B documentation is used for 4.0B through 4.0E (ie. not
much changed).

I think the only "big" difference between A and F is the company/name
change (from Digital UNIX to Compaq Tru64 UNIX). That, and it has MANY
fixes (like the "panic on simultaneous SCSI error" patch that I added to
my 4.0D system).

