Check the source format.  If the source came from a DOS or
Windows platform, you probably have carriage returns instead
of newlines.  Use something like:
  od -c file | more 

Use the "tr" command to translate all the "\r"
characters to "\n".

Hope this helps,
-Bob Arendt

